DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJennifer MelnickPamela Rose wi
 th Wayne De La Cruz – Hammond Organ Party!\nLive Jazz & Blues at it’s 
 best\, with this groovin’ quartet right in the heart of North Beach\, at
  San Francisco’s most beloved Jazz club.\n\nHammond Organ Party!\, an in
 explicably rare encounter between a soul-drenched singer and a prodigious 
 B-3 practitioner. Loose and limber\, moving and grooving\, this project fe
 els like a Saturday night celebration\, with Rose and her top-shelf cast r
 omping through rare jazz standards\, blues and R&B classics.Joined onstage
  by guitar great Danny Caron (Charles Brown\, Bonnie Raitt)\, drummer Mark
  Lee\, this group is ready to Party!\n“Hammond Organ Party! is an except
 ional collaboration…Rose and De La Cruz have hit a home run!” – Pete
  Fallico\, Doodlin’ Lounge\n“Outstanding vocals…Rose hits that jazz 
 & soul sweet spot with Wayne De La Cruz and Hammond Organ Party!” Frank-
 John Hadley\, DownBeat\n\n$30.00\n\nTickets: https://keysjazzbistro.com/ev
 ent/pamela-rose-wayne-de-la-cruz-hammond-organ-party-3/?se-date=85307\nDet
 ails: https://sf.funcheap.com/pamela-rose-hammond-organ-party/\nSource: Fu
 ncheap SF
