DESCRIPTION:Shipyard Trust for the ArtsLight\, sound and memories on the S
 hipyard crane.\nCRANE opens with a watch party at Zaccho Dance Theatre.\nA
 rtists transform the giant gantry crane at Hunters Point Shipyard into an 
 after-dark theater of light\, original music and community history\, honor
 ing the people who built and worked the Shipyard\, many from African Ameri
 can families who still live in Bayview Hunters Point.\nCrane Opening Night
  Watch Party\nFriday\, October 9\, 2026 | 7p\nZaccho Dance Theatre\, 1777 
 Yosemite Avenue\, Suite 330\, SF\nTickets start at $25 per seat\; $10 comm
 unity price for 94124 residents.\nEvent Schedule:\n\n7pm – Doors open\n7
 :30pm – Welcome\n7:45pm – Dr. George W. Davis Senior Center Choir sing
 s live in the room\n8-8:40pm – CRANE performance streams live from the p
 ier\nAfter the performance – Full CRANE artist team talk with the audien
 ce\nNote: This is the only artist talk of the run.\n\nThe crane is not vis
 ible from Zaccho\; the performance is viewed on screen\, with the choir si
 nging live in the room. Everyone has a seat. Space is limited.\nCan’t ma
 ke it? Every performance streams free online October 9\, 10\, 16 and 17 at
  7:45 pm\, and there are more watch parties at Hunters Point Shipyard Buil
 ding 101 on October 16 and 17.\nArtists:\n\nIan Winters – Video\nEvelyn 
 Ficarra – Composer\nElaine Buckholtz – Lighting\nStacey Carter – Shi
 pyard History and Community Engagement\nWilliam Rhodes – Community Engag
 ement\n\nProduced by Shipyard Trust for the Arts.\n\nAbout CRANE\nIn Octob
 er 2026\, the historic ga...\n\n$25.00\n\nTickets: https://shipyardartists
 .com/crane\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/crane-opening-night-watch-par
 ty-zaccho-dance-theatre-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crane-
 IG-post-blue-lights-theater.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T010330Z
LOCATION:Zaccho Dance Theatre\, 1777 Yosemite Ave\, Studio 330\, San Franc
 isco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/crane-opening-night-watch-party-zaccho-dance-t
 heatre-sf/
END:VEVENT
