BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exile to Hollywood : Violin & Piano Concert at Alliance Française
  de San Francisco
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T200000
DTSTAMP:20261014T171851Z
UID:funcheap-1639809@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizeralliance Française de San Fra
 nciscoAt the dawn of the twentieth century\, the antisemitism of totalitar
 ian regimes compelled many Jewish composers from Central and Eastern Europ
 e into exile. Fleeing pogroms and persecution\, they settled in the United
  States—the new Promised Land—and found their way to Hollywood. Musici
 ans such as Max Steiner\, Erich Wolfgang Korngold\, Franz Waxman\, Miklós
  Rózsa\, Bronisław Kaper\, Irving Berlin\, and Dimitri Tiomkin establish
 ed their distinctive musical voice there. Trained in the European classica
 l tradition\, they fused it with American culture and the idioms of jazz. 
 Bridging the legacy of the “world of yesterday” and the spirit of mode
 rnity\, they helped shape the art of film scoring and left an enduring imp
 rint on Hollywood’s Golden Age (1930s–1960s).\nAu début du 20e siècl
 e\, l’antisémitisme des régimes totalitaires pousse de nombreux compos
 iteurs juifs d’Europe centrale et orientale à l’exil. Fuyant pogroms 
 et persécutions\, ils s’installent aux États-Unis – nouvelle terre p
 romise – et rejoignent Hollywood. Des musiciens comme Max Steiner\, Eric
 h Wolfgang Korngold\, Franz Waxman\, Miklós Rózsa\, Bronisław Kaper\, I
 rving Berlin ou Dimitri Tiomkin y imposent leur style. Formés à la musiq
 ue savante européenne\, ils la mêlent à la culture américaine et au ja
 zz. Entre héritage du « monde d’hier » et modernité\, ils façonnent
  la musique de film et marquent durablement l’âge d’or du cinéma hol
 lywoodien\, le Golden Age (années 19...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.a
 fsf.com/event-rsvp/exile-to-hollywood-violin-and-piano-concert-at-alliance
 -francaise-sf/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/exile-hollywood-violin-pi
 ano-concert-alliance-franaise-de-san-francisco/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Captur
 e-decran-2026-09-28-a-16.40.31.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T171851Z
LOCATION:Alliance Française of San Francisco\, 1345 Bush Street\, San Fra
 ncisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/exile-hollywood-violin-piano-concert-alliance-
 franaise-de-san-francisco/
END:VEVENT
