BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GREEN FILM FESTIVAL: Don't Be Prey
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T200000
DTSTAMP:20261013T170024Z
UID:dothebay-17947951@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Green Film Festival presents:\n\nDON’T BE PREY\n\nAn edge-of
 -your-seat adventure into one man’s fight to reclaim his life by taking 
 on the world’s most dangerous marathon swims\, the Oceans Seven. Featuri
 ng unforgettable characters\, raw vulnerability and breathtaking ocean fea
 ts\, it’s a gripping\, uplifting journey of resilience\, reinvention and
  what it really takes to survive.\n\nQ&A with filmmaker and subject expect
 ed after the screening.\n\nCo-presented by the International Ocean Film Fo
 undation.\n\nTHE LOCALS\n\nThe San Francisco Bay is a hub for imports\, ta
 nkers\, sailboats\, rowing and swimming. It is also an estuary where marin
 e species hunt\, feed\, visit and live. Yet few scientists have studied th
 e local sharks in the SF Bay in recent decades\, until now. Dr. Meghan Hol
 st founded OSEA (Ocean Science Expedition Academy) and leads citizen scien
 ce expeditions to monitor shark species and teach a new generation of scie
 ntists.\n\nQ&A with filmmaker expected after the screening.\n\nForget the 
 guilt trip\, the Green Film Festival of San Francisco\, the mischievous\, 
 tree-hugging cousin of the 29 year old SF IndieFest\, returns Oct 15-22 to
  prove that saving the planet doesn't have to feel like homework. We've di
 tched the doom-and-gloom documentaries that make you want to crawl under a
  (sustainably sourced) blanket and never come out. The line-up this year p
 airs sharp environmental storytelling with wit\, weirdness\, and unapologe
 tic irreverence. And yes\, our Eco-Horror midnight movie is back!\n\nWheth
 er...\n\nTickets: https://greenfest2026.eventive.org/live_schedule/6aa4c4d
 77bb1d9678f1554fd\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/green-f
 ilm-festival-don-t-be-prey-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34917254/8726cf87-4a39-466b-82db-6532449ad5b0.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013T170024Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/green-film-festival-don-t-be-pr
 ey-tickets
END:VEVENT
