DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLit Laugh LyricThis autumn’s
  Lit Laugh Lyric comes to Mabuhay Gardens for a night of haunting spoken w
 ords\, eerie comedy and frightening melodies.\nLit Laugh Lyric is a quarte
 rly variety show that brings together three art forms in one night bringin
 g you groundbreaking emerging Bay Area artists in literature\, comedy and 
 music. This edition of the show is slated to feature performances by:\n\nL
 ine Up:\nMary Syring\nOliver Graves\nJonas Castillo\nEli The Funemployed C
 omic\nAndre Margatini\na.K.aye\nEdrei Sayo\nTilde Mouw\n\nFree\n\nTickets:
