DESCRIPTION:After Jonathan Harker attacks Dracula at his castle\, the vamp
 ire travels to a nearby city\, where he preys on the family of Harker’s 
 fiancée. The only one who may be able to protect them is Dr. van Helsing\
 , Harker’s friend and fellow-student of vampires\, who is determined to 
