DESCRIPTION:SF Short Film Festival presents:\n\nCALIFORNIA SUITS YOU\n\nA 
 writer\, tasked with interviewing the owner of a store during its grand op
 ening\, finds an album cover that shouldn't exist and becomes determined t
 o find out what that record holds.\n\nCHASE YOUR DREAMS\n\nLed by the flut
 tering allure of a childhood dream\, a dancer embarks on a whimsical\, bre
 athless journey\, a choreography of pursuit\, a a literal\, continuous spr
 int\, moving one beat ahead of the rhythm\, she must fight through a gaunt
 let of detours threatening to derail her from her childhood wish.\n\nLIFE 
 GOES ON\n\nBILL is in end of life care waiting for the sweet release of de
 ath - but unfortunately for him\, he's stuck in an infinite time loop\, ca
 using the day to restart the second his heart stops... A darkly comic yet 
 sweet and hopeful film about enjoying the time you have left and saying th
 e important things to the important people. Starring BAFTA winner David Br
 adley (Harry Potter\, Game of Thrones).\n\nNORMAL KIDS\n\nTeo and Mikey ar
 e inseparable friends - until a small betrayal sparks a fight before their
  school’s year-end show.\n\nSCHIZM\n\nA man grappling with bizarre side 
 effects from losing a loved one\, opens up about his struggle on YouTube\,
  forming an unexpected bond with a young girl.\n\nDERIVE\n\nGuided by post
 humous instructions to release her ex-wife’s ashes\, a reclusive book pu
 blisher embarks on a Surrealist odyssey (a dérive) across New York City\,
  experiencing a series of spontaneous connections along the way that inspi
 re...\n\nTickets: https://sfshorts2026.eventive.org/schedule/6aac194e4f814
 d88464e01fc\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/19/sf-short-film
 -festival-spontaneous-connections-shorts-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
