DESCRIPTION:October 22–November 9\, 2025\n\n2 hours\, 30 minutes\, inclu
 ding one intermission\n\nOrpheum Theatre | 1192 Market St. San Francisco\,
  CA 94102\n\nBEHIND EVERY POWERFUL WOMAN ARE MORE POWERFUL WOMEN.\n\nDirec
 t from Broadway\, comes the acclaimed Tony Award®-winning musical SUFFS a
 bout the brilliant\, passionate\, and funny American women who fought tire
 lessly for the right to vote. Created by Shaina Taub\, the first woman to 
 ever independently win Tony Awards for Best Book and Best Score in the sam
 e season\, this “thrilling\, inspiring and dazzlingly entertaining” (V
 ariety) new musical boldly explores the triumphs and failures of a struggl
 e for equality that’s far from over. Winner of the Outer Critics’ Circ
 le Award for Best New Musical.\n\n“Like all of the best Broadway musical
 s\, SUFFS humanizes\, empowers\, moves\, and entertains.” - Chicago Trib
 une\n\nAGES & ADVISORIES: Recommended for ages 10+. No children under 5 al
 lowed.\n\nAMERICAN SIGN LANGUAGE PERFORMANCE: Saturday\, November 8 at 1:0
 0PM\n\nAUDIO DESCRIPTION is available through GalaPro (for all performance
 s starting Saturday\, October 25).\n\nA limited number of $40 Rush tickets
  will be sold 2 hours prior to curtain at the Orpheum Theatre Box Office f
 or all performances beginning Friday 10/24\; Saturday & Sunday performance
 s are limited view and single seats only. Tickets are subject to availabil
 ity. Cash or credit. 2 per person. Rush tickets are void if resold.\n\nDow
 nload the TodayTix app in the iOS App Store or Google Play Store to unlock
  the Rush...\n\nTickets: https://www.broadwaysf.com/events/suffs/\nDetails
 : https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/suffs-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
