SUMMARY:Bay Area Immersive Theater Makers Gathering: Performer Perspective
 s
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T200000
DTSTAMP:20261014T214646Z
UID:dothebay-17955962@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Join Detour Productions for a community conversation focused o
 n the performer's perspective in immersive\, site-specific\, and audience-
 interactive performance.\n\nThis gathering brings together a group of Bay 
 Area performers for a moderated roundtable about the craft and experience 
 of immersive performance. The conversation will explore devising and build
 ing roles\, working in close proximity to audiences\, improvisation and au
 dience interaction\, navigating boundaries and unpredictability\, and what
  makes performers excited to say yes to a project.\n\nFollowing the roundt
 able\, the conversation will open to the room for questions\, discussion\,
  and connection with other artists working in and around immersive perform
 ance.\n\nModerated by Alex Locust / Glamputee and Eric Garcia / Churro Nom
 i.\n\nPanelists include Jo Williams\, Ja'Moon Jones\, Livanna Marissa Mais
 len\, Ava Roy\, Natalia Roberts\, and Chris Steele aka Polly Amber Ross.\n
 \nThis gathering is performer-focused\, but you don't have to be a perform
 er to attend. Directors\, producers\, designers\, administrators\, collabo
 rators\, and anyone curious about immersive performance are welcome.\n\nFr
 ee\, RSVP required.\n\nPresented by Detour Productions\n\nFree\nDetour Pro
 ductions\n\nTickets: https://detour.productions/2026/immersive-gathering-p
 erformers\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/26/bay-area-immers
 ive-theater-makers-gathering-performer-perspectives-tickets\nSource: DoThe
 Bay
