SUMMARY:Deadbeat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T213000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17930720@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:TRASH & TREASURES presents:\n\nDEADBEAT AT DAWN\n\n(with Live 
 Opening Set from Meat Hook & the Vital Organs)\n\nHe quit the gangs. They 
 killed his girl. He became\n\nGoose leaves the gang life behind after plea
 s from his girlfriend. But it isn’t long before he’s pulled back into 
 the world of violence.\n\nMEAT HOOK AND THE VITAL ORGANS\n\n"Meat Hook And
  The Vital Organs" Originated in Oakland California in 2007 and relocated 
 to Austin Texas in 2015. We are ripped from the same cloth as 'Motorhead"\
 , 'The Cramps ' and 'The Damned'. We continue to hold the torch for theatr
 ical Rock N'Roll. Influenced by intense in your face Raw Rock N' Roll grea
 ts like 'Iggy Pop' from 'The Stooges" and "Darby Crash" from "The Germs". 
 with a Horrific live show only to be compared to theatrical icons like "Th
 e Plasmatics" "Alice Cooper" and "Screaming Lord Sutch". "Meat Hook And Th
 e Vital Organs" is a theatrical death rock horror punk project with an ori
 ginal sound and live show yet modest enough to pay homage to classic inten
 se traditional Rock N' Roll which we like to call Rot N' Roll Or Death Gla
 m.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nDOORS at 7:00 PM | MUSIC at 7:30 PM | FILM at 8:15 
 PM\n\nCo-presented by Special Guest Horror Host Lance Von MeatHook.\n\nTic
