DESCRIPTION:“Sqream” Oasis’ Wild + Immersive ’90s Drag Horror Musi
 cal (Oct. 8-31)\nPseuda Name\nDo you like scary movie drag parodies???\nGe
 t ready for the RETURN of the ’90s slasher sing-along of your teenage dr
 eams! From the production team that brings you the immersive The Rocky Hor
 ror Show experience comes SQREAM\, a drag horror parody set to all your fa
 vorite hit songs of the 1990s. Join the gang as they navigate a super quee
 r whodunnit musical that spans the entire OASIS nightclub.\nThere are thre
 e entrance times for SQREAM: 6:30pm\, 6:45pm\, and 7pm.\nAll three entranc
 e times on the same night will lead you to the same showing.\n\nWho will s
 urvive? Who is the killer behind the gay Ghostface mask? How are they goin
 g to do the garage door scene? Are they seriously using “MMMbop?!” Fin
 d out in a night of singing\, dancing\, blood-drenched comedy that’s as 
 campy\, sexy\, & gory as your millennial adolescence. They’re ready to s
 lay… are you?\nBack by popular demand\, get your tickets now before your
  chances are SLASHED away!\nTimed entry at 6:30PM\, 6:45PM or 7PM\; all gr
 oups see the same performance.\nPerformance Dates:\nOct. 8\, 9\,10\, 14\, 
 15\, 16\, 17\, 21\, 22\, 23\, 24\, 26\, 28\, 29\, 30 and 31.\n\nUpcoming 
 “Sqream” Oasis’ Wild + Immersive ’90s Drag Horror Musical (Oct. 8-
 31) Events\nFri 10/9 “Sqream” Oasis’ Wild + Immersive ’90s Drag Ho
 rror Musical (Oct. 8-31)Sat 10/31 “Sqream” Oasis’ Wild + Immersive 
 ’90s Drag Horror Musical (Halloween 2026)Disclaimer: Please double check
  event information with the event organize...\n\n$50.00\n\nTickets: https:
 //www.eventbrite.com/e/sqream-tickets-1999540673982\nDetails: https://sf.f
 uncheap.com/sqream-oasis-wild-immersive-90s-drag-horror-musical-halloween-
 2026/\nSource: Funcheap SF
