BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Behind-the-Scenes Talk: How SF Neo-Futurists Run 100 Shows a 
 Year (SF Main Library)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T193000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639766@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:SF Neo-FuturistsLearn what it takes to write\, direct and perf
 orm 100 SHOWS A YEAR as a small group of artists who also RUN THE BUSINESS
  together. It’s not a sitcom\, it’s The San Francisco Neo-Futurists. T
 hey put on the Infinite Wrench\, the show the SF Chronicle calls one of 
 “22 San Francisco things everyone must do!”\nThey’ll pull back the c
 urtain on how they operate as a non-hierarchical consensus-based collectiv
 e to organize performance space\, run committees\, budget and raise funds 
 and ultimately put on a show every week. They’ll also cover their proces
 s for writing new material for a new cast of performers to put on a differ
 ent show every Friday and Saturday night.\nThe SF Neos are a collective of
  wildly prolific artists dedicated to the perpetual creation of experiment
 al theatre that is immediate\, ephemeral\, accessible and cheap. They beli
 eve the stage is an extension of daily life: they perform as themselves in
  a non-illusory\, interactive style that challenges the audience to create
  alongside them as active participants with a voice of their own. They res
 pect and uplift each other on and off stage through non-hierarchical accou
 ntability\, collective decision-making and anti-oppression practice of all
  kinds.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/11/04/presentatio
 n-collectively-operating-performance-theater-sf\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/free-behindthescenes-talk-sf-neofuturists-run-100-shows-year-sf-ma
 in-library/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Neo-Fu
 turists-Booked.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:SFPL Main Library Steve Silver Room (4th Floor)\, 100 Larkin Stre
 et\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-behindthescenes-talk-sf-neofuturists-run-
 100-shows-year-sf-main-library/
END:VEVENT
