DESCRIPTION:Throwin’ Bo’s presents:\n\nGreen-House\n\nGreen-House is a
  project birthed by Olive Ardizoni and now officially a duo project featur
 ing long-time collaborator and confidant\, Michael Flanagan. Approaching t
 he project with an intentional naivety\, they craft songs that find freedo
 m through simplicity. They hope to create a space with fewer barriers as b
 oth a performer and a listener.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nCool Maritime\n\ncool 
 maritime is immersive music and sound design by sean hellfritsch\n\nBandca
 mp | IG\n\nDOORS at 7:00PM | MUSIC at 8:00 PM\n\nTickets: https://consumer
 .pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2F2001390452720%3Faf
