DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCourtesy of Zoppe Family Circu
 sThe Zoppé Italian Family Circus returns to Redwood City from November 6-
 29 for the nineteenth year\, with evening shows and weekend matinees\, plu
 s special holiday showtimes!\nA cherished European tradition for over 180 
 years\, this old-world circus continues to delight families with its heart
 felt charm\, right here in the heart of the Peninsula. Under the intimate 
 Big Top\, audiences can enjoy two hours of laughter\, wonder\, and breatht
 aking artistry\, all delivered with genuine Italian warmth and flair! Expe
 rience daring acrobatics\, galloping horses\, playful dogs\, and the laugh
 ter of Nino the Clown\, accompanied by the vibrant sound of live music.\n\
 nThe Zoppé Italian Family Circus is warm\, welcoming and perfect for fami
 lies\, many of whom return year after year. With every seat within 20 feet
  of the ring\, even the littlest guests won’t miss a moment. Come see wh
 at makes the Zoppé Family Circus unforgettable this November.\nTicket Pur
 chase and more info at https://www.redwoodcity.org/zoppe\n1 hour prior to 
 the first showtime of each day – In person at the Circus Tent only\nMati
 nee and Evening Shows with Special Weekday and Matinee Pricing\nTicket ran
 ge:\nYouth (Ages 2-11) – $12-$25\, Adults (12+) – $17-$30\, Front row 
 (All ages) $24-$37\nCash and Credit Cards are accepted for in-person trans
 actions.\nChildren under 2 must sit on laps – NO CAR SEATS\nWheelchair A
 ccessible Seating (front row)\nTicket prices vary per days and showtimes\,
 ...\n\n$17.00\n\nTickets: https://www.redwoodcity.org/zoppe\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/zopp-italian-family-circus-2026-redwood-city-nov-629/\
