 ion Open Mic (w/out a mic)Thu 11/19 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)D
 isclaimer: Please double check event information with the event organizer 
 as events can be canceled\, details can change after they are added to our
  calendar\, and errors do occur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.
 com/groups/103422546416088\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/16th-mission-
 open-mic-w-out-a-mic-264/\nSource: Funcheap SF
