BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Carpenters Songbook
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17504221@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:A Live Celebration\n\nA Live Celebration\n\nUS Tour - 3 venues
 \n\nThe Carpenters Songbook: A Live Celebration\, brings the icon’s extr
 aordinary voice and the brother-sister duo’s unforgettable music back to
  the stage in a beautifully crafted all-new production from the creative t
 eam behind The Simon & Garfunkel Story.\n\nFew voices in pop history are a
 s instantly recognizable\, or as deeply loved\, as Karen Carpenter’s. Th
 e Carpenters Songbook: A Live Celebration\, brings the icon’s extraordin
 ary voice and the brother-sister duo’s unforgettable music back to the s
 tage in a beautifully crafted all-new production from the creative team be
 hind The Simon & Garfunkel Story.\n\nWith a full band and heartfelt storyt
 elling\, this concert captures the warmth\, emotion\, and musical brillian
 ce of The Carpenters. It’s a touching tribute that invites audiences to 
 sing-along\, reminisce\, and fall in love all over again. Expect to relive
  all of their favorites including We’ve Only Just Begun\, Close to You\,
  and Rainy Days and Mondays with this heartfelt love letter to the quiet m
 agic of Karen and Richard Carpenter.\n\nEmerson Colonial Theatre\n\nWed\, 
 Oct 7\, 2026\n\nFisher Theatre\n\nSun\, Oct 11\, 2026\n\nMajestic Theatre\
 n\nWed\, Nov 11\, 2026\n\nTickets: https://us.atgtickets.com/events/carpen
 ters-songbook/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/2/the-carpent
 ers-songbook-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7825715;-122.4110742
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32875447/6925c4ae-4f59-47a8-95b8-6c12019e2f65.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Golden Gate Theatre\, 1 Taylor St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/2/the-carpenters-songbook-tickets
END:VEVENT
